{"id":"4e19de0e-63f5-445c-8cac-91003340cb3f","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:06:29.928Z","batchId":"onboarding_inkling-small-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"inkling-small-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div>\n      <h1>Onboarding</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead muted\">Set up your workspace in three steps.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Stepper -->\n    <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n      <div class=\"stack center gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n        <div id=\"dot1\" class=\"badge badge-outline\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"small\" id=\"label1\"><strong>Account</strong></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-connector\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stack center gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n        <div id=\"dot2\" class=\"badge badge-secondary\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\" id=\"label2\">Preferences</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-connector\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stack center gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n        <div id=\"dot3\" class=\"badge badge-secondary\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;\">3</div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\" id=\"label3\">Done</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <!-- Step 1: Account -->\n      <div id=\"content-1\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Account</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Create your workspace identity.</div>\n        <form class=\"stack gap-sm\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); goTo(2);\">\n          <label>\n            <span>Full name</span>\n            <input type=\"text\" value=\"Jordan Reyes\" />\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Work email</span>\n            <input type=\"email\" value=\"jordan@team.com\" />\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Password</span>\n            <input type=\"password\" value=\"************\" />\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Confirm password</span>\n            <input type=\"password\" value=\"************\" />\n          </label>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Step 2: Preferences -->\n      <div id=\"content-2\" style=\"display:none;\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Preferences</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Customize your experience.</div>\n        <form class=\"stack gap-sm\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); goTo(3);\">\n          <label>\n            <span>Your role</span>\n            <select>\n              <option>Product Designer</option>\n              <option>Engineer</option>\n              <option>Lead</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"small\">Notifications</span>\n            <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Weekly digest</label>\n              <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Team updates</label>\n              <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" /> New comments</label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"small\">Theme</span>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n              <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"system\" checked /> System</label>\n              <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"light\" /> Light</label>\n              <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"dark\" /> Dark</label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Step 3: Done -->\n      <div id=\"content-3\" style=\"display:none;\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-lg center\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:72px;height:72px;\">JR</div>\n          <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <h2>You're all set</h2>\n            <p class=\"lead muted\">Jordan Reyes — Product Designer</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n            <div class=\"row between\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Role</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">Designer</div>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Theme</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">System</div>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Plan</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">Pro</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Your workspace is ready. You can change settings anytime from your profile.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <button id=\"btn-back\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"back()\" style=\"visibility:hidden;\">Back</button>\n      <button id=\"btn-next\" class=\"btn\" onclick=\"next()\">Continue</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.step-connector { flex:1; height:2px; background: var(--surface-2); margin:0 12px; min-width:24px; }\n</style>\n\n<script>\nlet step = 1;\nconst names = ['Account','Preferences','Done'];\nfunction goTo(n) { step = n; render(); }\nfunction next() {\n  if (step < 3) goTo(step + 1);\n  else { document.getElementById('btn-next').textContent = 'Go to Dashboard'; document.getElementById('btn-next').onclick = () => alert('Dashboard loaded'); }\n}\nfunction back() { if (step > 1) goTo(step - 1); }\nfunction render() {\n  for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {\n    document.getElementById('content-'+i).style.display = i === step ? '' : 'none';\n    const dot = document.getElementById('dot'+i);\n    const lbl = document.getElementById('label'+i);\n    if (i < step) {\n      dot.className = 'badge badge-destructive';\n      dot.style.background = '';\n      dot.style.color = '';\n      dot.innerHTML = '✓';\n      lbl.innerHTML = '<strong>'+names[i-1]+'</strong>';\n    } else if (i === step) {\n      dot.className = 'badge badge-outline';\n      dot.style.background = 'var(--fg)';\n      dot.style.color = '#fff';\n      dot.innerHTML = i;\n      lbl.innerHTML = '<strong>'+names[i-1]+'</strong>';\n    } else {\n      dot.className = 'badge badge-secondary';\n      dot.style.background = '';\n      dot.style.color = '';\n      dot.innerHTML = i;\n      lbl.innerHTML = names[i-1];\n    }\n  }\n  document.getElementById('btn-back').style.visibility = step === 1 ? 'hidden' : 'visible';\n  if (step === 3) {\n    document.getElementById('btn-next').textContent = 'Finish';\n    document.getElementById('btn-next').onclick = () => { alert('Onboarding complete — redirecting to dashboard.'); };\n  } else {\n    document.getElementById('btn-next').textContent = 'Continue';\n    document.getElementById('btn-next').onclick = next;\n  }\n}\nrender();\n</script>","deltas":[[14067,"<div class=\"page\">\n "],[15077," <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div>\n      <h1>Onboarding</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead muted\">Set up your workspace in three steps.</p>\n    </div>